<main id="main">
<section class="ph"><div class="ph-media"><img class="ph-img" src="/assets/img/photos/calculator.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/calculator-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/calculator.webp 1200w" sizes="100vw" width="1200" height="707" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"></div><div class="wrap ph-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><i aria-hidden="true">/</i><span aria-current="page">Calculators</span></nav><p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">Free &amp; private</p><h1>Free Insurance Claim Calculators for Michigan</h1><p class="ph-lede">Seven calculators and planners built from real appraisal work. Use them to understand your claim and test the carrier’s math. No sign-up, and nothing is stored.</p></div></section>
<section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="scards" data-stagger><a class="scard rv" href="/mi-claim-calculators/claim-gap-fee-estimator/"><span class="sc-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/calculator-papers.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/calculator-papers-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/calculator-papers.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="tc-kind">Estimator</span></span><span class="sc-body"><h2>Claim Gap &amp; Fee Estimator</h2><p>Measure the gap between two estimates and see what appraisal might net after fees.</p><span class="more">Open the tool <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="scard rv" href="/mi-claim-calculators/rcv-acv-holdback-calculator/"><span class="sc-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/calculator.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/calculator-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/calculator.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="707" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="tc-kind">Calculator</span></span><span class="sc-body"><h2>RCV &amp; ACV Holdback Calculator</h2><p>Depreciate line items, see the first check and how much holdback you can recover.</p><span class="more">Open the tool <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="scard rv" href="/mi-claim-calculators/roof-squares-pitch-calculator/"><span class="sc-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/roofers.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/roofers-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/roofers.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="900" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="tc-kind">Calculator</span></span><span class="sc-body"><h2>Roof Squares &amp; Pitch Calculator</h2><p>Convert footprint and pitch into squares, bundles and eave ice-barrier rows.</p><span class="more">Open the tool <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="scard rv" href="/mi-claim-calculators/percentage-deductible-calculator/"><span class="sc-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/lightning.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/lightning-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/lightning.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="626" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="tc-kind">Calculator</span></span><span class="sc-body"><h2>Percentage Deductible Calculator</h2><p>Turn a 1% or 2% deductible into dollars and compare it with a flat deductible.</p><span class="more">Open the tool <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="scard rv" href="/mi-claim-calculators/claim-deadline-planner/"><span class="sc-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/clipboard.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/clipboard-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/clipboard.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="798" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="tc-kind">Planner</span></span><span class="sc-body"><h2>Claim Deadline Planner</h2><p>Build a claim calendar, estimate tolling and export every date to your calendar.</p><span class="more">Open the tool <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="scard rv" href="/mi-claim-calculators/appraisal-readiness-score/"><span class="sc-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/paperwork.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/paperwork-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/paperwork.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="798" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="tc-kind">Checklist</span></span><span class="sc-body"><h2>Appraisal Readiness Score</h2><p>Ten questions that show whether your claim file is ready for appraisal.</p><span class="more">Open the tool <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="scard rv" href="/mi-claim-calculators/ice-dam-risk-cost-estimator/"><span class="sc-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/snow-roofs.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/snow-roofs-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/snow-roofs.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="tc-kind">Estimator</span></span><span class="sc-body"><h2>Ice Dam Risk &amp; Cost Estimator</h2><p>Rate ice dam risk by snow belt and attic, and size illustrative interior repairs.</p><span class="more">Open the tool <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec sec-ice"><div class="wrap split split-top"><div class="rv"><p class="eyebrow">Suggested order</p><h2>Using the tools together</h2><ol class="steps-list"><li>Start with the <a href="/mi-claim-calculators/claim-deadline-planner/">claim deadline planner</a> so no date slips.</li><li>Check roof math, including eave ice barrier, with the <a href="/mi-claim-calculators/roof-squares-pitch-calculator/">roof squares and pitch calculator</a>.</li><li>Had water come through a ceiling in winter? Try the <a href="/mi-claim-calculators/ice-dam-risk-cost-estimator/">ice dam risk and cost estimator</a>.</li><li>See what you’ll actually receive with the <a href="/mi-claim-calculators/percentage-deductible-calculator/">percentage deductible</a> and <a href="/mi-claim-calculators/rcv-acv-holdback-calculator/">holdback</a> calculators.</li><li>Test the dispute with the <a href="/mi-claim-calculators/claim-gap-fee-estimator/">claim gap and fee estimator</a>.</li><li>Finish with the <a href="/mi-claim-calculators/appraisal-readiness-score/">appraisal readiness score</a>.</li></ol></div><div class="rv"><div class="sbox sbox-call"><h2 class="sbox-t">Talk to an appraiser</h2><p>A free, no-pressure call. We’ll tell you plainly whether appraisal fits your claim.</p><a class="sbox-phone" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> +1 (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn btn-maize btn-block" href="/request-claim-review/">Send claim details</a><small>Mon–Fri 8am–6pm ET</small></div></div></div></section>
